    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical medieval world, the world is divided into two major camps, a battle between justice and evil. Which side would you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.poster.avif?t=1755601885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.webm?t=1755601885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.mp4?t=1755601885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Medieval</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique units such as knights and orcs, buildings with special functions, equipment with powerful abilities, cute pixel style, and rich content.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting game format</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruiting soldiers can provide immediate combat power, buildings can both acquire resources and enhance soldiers' combat effectiveness, and equipment can greatly improve the combat effectiveness of individual soldiers. Reasonable utilization of resources is the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Connection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game supports both single player and online modes.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical medieval world, the world is divided into two major camps, a battle between justice and evil. Which side would you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.poster.avif?t=1755601885\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.webm?t=1755601885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418670/extras/beb46f5d2f1641e185959dc9d07d3290.mp4?t=1755601885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Medieval</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique units such as knights and orcs, buildings with special functions, equipment with powerful abilities, cute pixel style, and rich content.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting game format</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruiting soldiers can provide immediate combat power, buildings can both acquire resources and enhance soldiers' combat effectiveness, and equipment can greatly improve the combat effectiveness of individual soldiers. Reasonable utilization of resources is the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Connection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game supports both single player and online modes.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "This is a medieval strategy war game where you can freely choose your faction, acquire resources, purchase armies from crystals, strengthen yourself, defeat enemy armies, break down enemy walls, and destroy enemy crystals to win the game. You can compete with AI and invite friends to play online.",
